/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It's notable to see that Coodu Trust is actively working towards creating a sustainable and thriving rural sector. The focus on providing support to young men and women in rural areas, particularly those involved in small-scale farming, aligns with the goal of ensuring fulfilling lives while addressing the global challenge of food security.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Key initiatives such as providing training, securing land tenure, offering credit, and promoting access to new technologies demonstrate a holistic approach to empowering small farmers. The emphasis on environmentally sustainable methods is crucial in the face of climate change, acknowledging the need for adaptation and mitigation strategies.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
