283 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( The State Planning Commission has been identified us as the coordinating agency to implement Sustainably Livelihood Enhancement through Scientific Management of Dairy Animals project at Kadavur Block, Karur District and 100 Joint Liability Groups formed. .In kadavur block, Thanragampatti Dairy Farmers Producer Company Limited was promoted with women farmers to promote dairy based activities with 500 women farmers )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Under this programme ,training on dairy farming has given to 260 women farmers and 10 milk collection centres were established and 1800 litres milk collected daily from the women and milk is marketed through Raj Dairy milk .Weekly payment is made to the beneficiaries.Now the women are getting a minimum of Rs.32 /liter to a maximum of  Rs.45 /liter as per the SNF value.We have approached SBGF for loan to 500 Milch animals with subsidy)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
285 0 obj
<<
