324 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Under Corporate Social Responsibility of Ever send enterprises had supported to complete the watershed development activities at Thirunelveli District. There were two activities ware taken for Watershed Development one is community mobilization and institution building. In this activity, 100 farmers were mobilized into watershed development area as beneficiaries. Among them 30 farmers were formed watershed development committee, they were trained on cultivation technologies of crop and livestock management. And second one is water resource development activities of 9200 tree were planted in waste land and watershed catchment area, and water reservoir and small water recharge shifting activities were done and 6 ponds were desiltted for increasing the water holding capacity. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
