>>
endobj
444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Ministry of Rural Development \(MoRD\) announced the Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Grameen Kaushalya Yojana \(DDU-GKY\) with the dual objectives of adding diversity to the incomes of rural poor families and cater to the career aspirations of rural youth. DDU-GKY is uniquely focused on rural between the ages of 15 and 35 years from poor families.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
445 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( Coodu Trust as Project Implementing Agency \(PIA\) completed the rural youths on skill training programme at Karur District and empanelled as training partner in NSDC and TNSDC . )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
446 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( During 2022-2023, 124 numbers of youths were training in Sewing Machine operators course . Out 124 trained youth, 120 trained youth were placed for job in the reputed industries in Suprime Industries, Mithra, SJ Catering College and V.T. Skill Training Institute etc.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
447 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( Out of 624 total trained, those trained 586 women were placed in the reputed industries like Aisan Fabric Private Limited , Imayam Garments , Mithra Enterprises and  Supreme Industries respectively.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
