<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our COODU Trust had conducted the youth skill training with the support of State Government . Under National Rurban Mission, our trust implemented the Sewing Machine Operators training to 20 women in Thirunelveli District. And out 20, 11 beneficiaries were got job opportunities in private company remaining 9 women started self-employment. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
