624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( To engage in corporate social responsibility CSR means that, in the ordinary course of business, a company is operating in ways that enhance society and the environment instead of contributing negatively to them. In this process Renault Nissan Automotive Indian Private Limited \(RNAIPL\) has interested and involved CSR activity at Padappai Pamchayat, Kanchipuram District.          )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
625 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (          Coodu Trust had involved and completed the one of the CSR activities of erection of ECOMIC Machine at Padappai and Urapakkam Pamchayat, Kanchipuram District.  Besides, in this panchayat solid management awareness campaign was conducted Village level on Social Engineering, IEC and monitoring and branding activities etc. And Village sanitary workers of sweepers, drivers and other helpers were trained maintenance follow up activities. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [11]
>>
